    <tok fileIndex="0" linenr="34" column="1" str="/* * Notice that USE_OPENLDAP is only a source code selection switch. When * libcurl is built with USE_OPENLDAP defined the libcurl source code that * gets compiled is the code from openldap.c, otherwise the code that gets * compiled is the code from ldap.c. * * When USE_OPENLDAP is defined a recent version of the OpenLDAP library * might be required for compilation and runtime. In order to use ancient * OpenLDAP library versions, USE_OPENLDAP shall not be defined. */"/>
